{"title":"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> be three distinct one-digit numbers. What is the maximum value of the sum of the roots of the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/4/3644adefa015a4780e5748c0da9842f1113c1a5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-a)(x-b)+(x-b)(x-c)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"275\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/6/be6e1709b6ce8ac4c3044dbee7c1a442e241c272.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }15\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }15.5\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }16\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }16.5\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"427\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Expanding the equation and combining like terms results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/c/95cb427b83c369df381823fd329d4efb22ab5279.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x^2-(a+2b+c)x+(ab+bc)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"277\" height=\"19\" />. By Vieta's formula the sum of the roots is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/4/3743e38f1afcc5182d2a9da5e198ff8df18800ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{-[-(a+2b+c)]}{2}=\\dfrac{a+2b+c}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"240\" height=\"38\" />. To maximize this expression we want <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> to be the largest, and from there we can assign the next highest values to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />. So let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/c/15cc8804d5482ae978d97e7912aa9c768329ad49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=9$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/a/c1a0caf28dae25372408593f2d14ca238035568c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=8$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/4/df4c636bd4eadfbf8bf1447703d58c79214f3197.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=7$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />. Then the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/d/bfdcbc5c89a1e59c0ce18b8a52ab7cc1a535e7a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{8+18+7}{2}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)} 16.5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"182\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Factoring out <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/4/6e4a10dd00cb5fa2641e79515144dfa871adcd24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"18\" /> from the equation yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/1/131b24c4143f77ee4a2f6a3397cb3a7877e88d71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-b)(2x-(a+c))=0 \\Rightarrow (x-b)\\left(x-\\frac{a+c}{2}\\right)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"418\" height=\"43\" />. Therefore the roots are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/2/f620b55d8a64de8b7669df5fcb658bcc8e2f2cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a+c}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"42\" height=\"35\" />. Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> must be the larger root to maximize the sum of the roots, letting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/b/f3b28547efd22be1c4a05fa193cd7038fc65d71b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/9/b29dd0d81ebbb47469065a09a3d5a0e86f14677f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8,9,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"30\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> respectively yields the sum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/1/2e1bb5f572b5017c4fbac72fc21ba8901a5c3074.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9+\\frac{8+7}{2} = 9+7.5 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}~16.5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"257\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/rkusS2sqCEo\">https://youtu.be/rkusS2sqCEo</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/sgbVftpqBs0\">https://youtu.be/sgbVftpqBs0</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B\">2015 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_13\" title